                    <section class="c-hero c-wrapper">
                        <h1 class="js-fadein">Web Marketing Business</h1>
                        <div class="c-hero-content js-fadein">
                            <div>
                                <h2 class="c-headline">Marketing that reaches the clinical frontline, delivered by a
                                    cardiology-specialized team</h2>
                                <p>Using “TCROSS NEWS,” a medical information platform specializing in cardiology, we
                                    support marketing initiatives that deliver accurate and reliable information to
                                    healthcare professionals.
                                    From planning and content production to distribution, we provide integrated support
                                    to ensure information reaches the right audience
                                </p>
                            </div>
                            <div>
                                <picture>
                                    <source srcset="../../../<%= ASSET_PATH %>asset/img/services/marketing_mv_sp.png"
                                        media="(max-width: 960px)">
                                    <img src="../../../<%= ASSET_PATH %>asset/img/services/marketing_mv.png" alt="Marketing that reaches the clinical frontline, delivered by a
                                    cardiology-specialized team">
                                </picture>
                            </div>
                        </div>
                    </section>

                    <section class="c-explanation">
                        <div class="c-explanation-bg">
                            <img src="../../../<%= ASSET_PATH %>asset/img/services/explanation2.jpg"
                                alt="“TCROSS NEWS,” Continuously Chosen by Frontline Cardiologists">
                            <div class="c-explanation-bg-overlay"></div>
                        </div>
                        <div class="c-explanation-content c-wrapper">
                            <h2>“TCROSS NEWS,”<br />
                                Continuously Chosen by<br />
                                Frontline Cardiologists
                            </h2>
                            <div>
                                <ul>
                                    <li>
                                        <h3>Extensive coverage in real clinical settings</h3>
                                        <p>TCROSS NEWS is used by approximately 43,000 registered cardiologists and
                                            records about 3.7 million monthly page views.
                                            It is a platform that delivers information directly to physicians actively
                                            engaged in clinical practice.
                                        </p>
                                    </li>
                                    <li>
                                        <h3>High engagement through specialized content</h3>
                                        <p>With more than 1,300 expert-oriented articles, engagement remains strong,
                                            including email newsletter open rates of up to 57% and click-through rates
                                            of up to 40%.
                                            The content is widely utilized in daily clinical settings.
                                        </p>
                                    </li>
                                    <li>
                                        <h3>Precise targeting through proprietary segmentation</h3>
                                        <p>
                                            Based on trend data and behavioral insights, we segment physicians by
                                            specialty, interests, career stage, and engagement status, enabling accurate
                                            targeting and messaging.
                                        </p>
                                    </li>
                                </ul>
                            </div>
                        </div>
                    </section>

